Optional local identity analysis uses OpenCV Python bindings and, only after an
explicit user action, downloads checksum-pinned model files from OpenCV Zoo.
The model files are not bundled with this plugin:

- YuNet face detection model: MIT License
  https://github.com/opencv/opencv_zoo/tree/main/models/face_detection_yunet
- SFace face recognition model: Apache License 2.0
  https://github.com/opencv/opencv_zoo/tree/main/models/face_recognition_sface

Their respective license files and notices remain controlling for those model
files. The installer records exact filenames and SHA-256 checksums and accepts
downloads only from the pinned OpenCV repository host.
